RopeServices UK
&amp;nbsp;
&amp;nbsp;
Pack of 8 x Gun Metal Black Decking Rope Cup Ends To Fit 28mm Rope.
&amp;nbsp;
Each Fitting Is Complete With All Fixing Screws
&amp;nbsp;

Screw the three fixing screws provided to your desired location.

Remove the centre screw, insert your rope, and use a 5mm engineering screwdriver to form a pilot hole through the rope,
&amp;nbsp;then insert centre screw using a screwdriver.

Our rope fittings are manufactured from solid brass, they are designed to withstand rust.
&amp;nbsp;
These are an excellent choice for outdoor and indoor use.
&amp;nbsp;
&amp;nbsp;
RopeServices UK offers a wide range of decking rope fittings from 20mm up to 50mm diameter.
&amp;nbsp;
These fittings are designed solely to fit our ropes.
&amp;nbsp;
Finishes Available - Polished Brass, Polished Chrome, Satin Nickel, Copper Bronze, Powder Coated Black, Gun Metal Black, Antique Brass
&amp;nbsp;
Fittings Available - Hooks, Eyeplates, Cup Ends, Handrail Brackets, End Caps
&amp;nbsp;
&amp;nbsp;
Our fittings are the perfect choice to finish any project, adding a touch of luxury and style.
&amp;nbsp;
&amp;nbsp;
Approximate Dimensions:
&amp;nbsp;
Centre Hole - 29.5mm
Baseplate - 57mm
Height - 37mm
&amp;nbsp;
Centre Screw - 35mm

